: "engenn8le07ob10re2img01.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn8le07ob10re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn8le07ob10re2img01.jpg", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn8le07ob10re2img01.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I think I'd like to watch some old Hollywood musicals this weekend.  <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: So would I. That's a great idea.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I'm not as well versed on names of musicals as I should be though.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Neither am I. We could ask at the DVD rental shop. I think they could recommend some.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: So do I. I could also look up some online.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: So could I. That would give us a list of as many movies as we could watch in an evening I think."}, {"time": "24500", "image": "engenn8le07ob10re2img05.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: So do I. I really hate to go on about that music festival, but I wasn't at all happy with it!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Neither was I. It wasn't nearly as good as others we've been to.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I wouldn't have shelled out all that cash on the tickets if I'd known.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I wouldn't have either. I don't think we could have known, though.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Neither do I. Live and learn, I guess. When you have been to as many good concerts as we've been to, we shouldn't complain."}, {"time": "49500", "image": "engenn8le07ob10re2img05.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Maybe this wasn't as interesting as others because we're a bit jaded.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: We did meet some interesting people.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: The busker that played was fun as well. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Do you think Peter would want to spend an evening watching musicals?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: For sure. He's a big movie buff. Besides, if there's food, he'll be ecstatic!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I think so too!"}]}}]}]}], "type": "sena"}